&lt;td style=&quot; padding-left:0; padding-right:0; padding-top:7; padding-bottom:11;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'AppleSDGothicNeo,Noto Sans KR,sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; font-weight:600; color:#666666;&quot;&gt;Reply timeout&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'AppleSDGothicNeo,Noto Sans KR,sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; color:#666666;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'AppleSDGothicNeo,Noto Sans KR,sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; font-weight:600; color:#666666;&quot;&gt;HSMS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'AppleSDGothicNeo,Noto Sans KR,sans-serif'; font-size:8pt; color:#666666;&quot;&gt; 에서 Primary Message를 전송한 다음 Reply Mesage를 설정된 시간안에 받지 못했을 때 발생 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
